# Purple colour follows concentration
# Expectation: Tenfold dilution of dilute KMnO4 should reduce absorbance and fade purple toward pink without losing permanganate inventory.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KMnO4 0.0001mol
look v1
measure v1 uvvis
dilute v1 900mL
look v1
measure v1 uvvis
inspect v1
